.trellis/spec/backend/quality-guidelines.md:1: trailing whitespace.
+# Quality Guidelines
.trellis/spec/backend/quality-guidelines.md:2: trailing whitespace.
+
.trellis/spec/backend/quality-guidelines.md:3: trailing whitespace.
+## Gate
.trellis/spec/backend/quality-guidelines.md:4: trailing whitespace.
+
.trellis/spec/backend/quality-guidelines.md:5: trailing whitespace.
+`just ci` is the definition of done for a change:
.trellis/spec/backend/quality-guidelines.md:6: trailing whitespace.
+
.trellis/spec/backend/quality-guidelines.md:7: trailing whitespace.
+1. `cargo fmt --all -- --check`
.trellis/spec/backend/quality-guidelines.md:8: trailing whitespace.
+2. `cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets -- -D warnings`
.trellis/spec/backend/quality-guidelines.md:9: trailing whitespace.
+3. `cargo test --workspace --all-targets`
.trellis/spec/backend/quality-guidelines.md:10: trailing whitespace.
+4. `cargo deny check`
.trellis/spec/backend/quality-guidelines.md:11: trailing whitespace.
+
.trellis/spec/backend/quality-guidelines.md:12: trailing whitespace.
+Rust 1.99.0, edition 2024. New crates inherit workspace lints (`unsafe_code = "forbid"`, `clippy::all = "warn"`).
.trellis/spec/backend/quality-guidelines.md:13: trailing whitespace.
+
.trellis/spec/backend/quality-guidelines.md:14: trailing whitespace.
+## Dependency pins
.trellis/spec/backend/quality-guidelines.md:15: trailing whitespace.
+
.trellis/spec/backend/quality-guidelines.md:16: trailing whitespace.
+Workspace `[workspace.dependencies]` records the latest stable release we have checked (2026-10-14): `thiserror` 2.0.21, `tracing` 0.1.44, `tracing-subscriber` 0.3.23, `clap` 4.6.7, `serde` 1.0.229, `toml` 1.1.8, `lopdf` 0.45.0, `notify` 8.2.0, `proptest` 1.12.0. Bump a pin by editing that table, not by writing a version inside one crate.
.trellis/spec/backend/quality-guidelines.md:17: trailing whitespace.
+
.trellis/spec/backend/quality-guidelines.md:18: trailing whitespace.
+Do not add GPL or AGPL crates. `deny.toml` enforces this. Do not add MuPDF.
.trellis/spec/backend/quality-guidelines.md:19: trailing whitespace.
+
.trellis/spec/backend/quality-guidelines.md:20: trailing whitespace.
+## Tests
.trellis/spec/backend/quality-guidelines.md:21: trailing whitespace.
+
.trellis/spec/backend/quality-guidelines.md:22: trailing whitespace.
+- State transitions live next to `PresentationState::apply_at`.
.trellis/spec/backend/quality-guidelines.md:23: trailing whitespace.
+- Property tests use `proptest` for invariants that are true for a range (generation ordering).
.trellis/spec/backend/quality-guidelines.md:24: trailing whitespace.
+- Do not `#[ignore]` a test to make CI green.
.trellis/spec/backend/quality-guidelines.md:25: trailing whitespace.
+- Default workspace checks exercise the pure Rust path. The separate `pdfium` feature suite requires the pinned native runtime and must fail when it is missing. A separate integration-test process checks failed initialization before any process-global bindings exist.
.trellis/spec/backend/quality-guidelines.md:26: trailing whitespace.
+- Raster goldens assert BGRA ordering, rotated/CropBox coordinates, alpha and same-density crop pixels. Performance uses uncached real renders, 20 warmups and all 200 timed samples; record runtime/fixture/font hashes and keep queue/upload time separate. Mock results do not establish native or GPU performance.
.trellis/spec/backend/quality-guidelines.md:27: trailing whitespace.
+
.trellis/spec/backend/quality-guidelines.md:28: trailing whitespace.
+## Forbidden
.trellis/spec/backend/quality-guidelines.md:29: trailing whitespace.
+
.trellis/spec/backend/quality-guidelines.md:30: trailing whitespace.
+- Importing GPUI, `winit`, or `windows` into `ferrostage-core`.
.trellis/spec/backend/quality-guidelines.md:31: trailing whitespace.
+- A child `HWND` for video. Frames are `SharedFrame` (BGRA8).
.trellis/spec/backend/quality-guidelines.md:32: trailing whitespace.
+- Converting BGRA to RGBA on the audience path.
.trellis/spec/backend/quality-guidelines.md:33: trailing whitespace.
+- Copying Pympress (GPL) source into this repository.
.trellis/spec/backend/quality-guidelines.md:34: trailing whitespace.
+- Linking PDFium or Zed in the default feature set until a task is ready to own that build time.
.trellis/spec/frontend/component-guidelines.md:1: trailing whitespace.
+# Component Guidelines
.trellis/spec/frontend/component-guidelines.md:2: trailing whitespace.
+
.trellis/spec/frontend/component-guidelines.md:3: trailing whitespace.
+A "component" is a GPUI view or element, not a React function component. There are no props objects and no JSX.
.trellis/spec/frontend/component-guidelines.md:4: trailing whitespace.
+
.trellis/spec/frontend/component-guidelines.md:5: trailing whitespace.
+## Rules
.trellis/spec/frontend/component-guidelines.md:6: trailing whitespace.
+
.trellis/spec/frontend/component-guidelines.md:7: trailing whitespace.
+- One view owns one window role (`WindowRole`).
.trellis/spec/frontend/component-guidelines.md:8: trailing whitespace.
+- The audience view's render input is `AudienceProjectionSnapshot`.
.trellis/spec/frontend/component-guidelines.md:9: trailing whitespace.
+- The presenter view may also read `ferrostage_document::SlideNotes`.
.trellis/spec/frontend/component-guidelines.md:10: trailing whitespace.
+- Video is a `ferrostage_media::SharedFrame` drawn as a BGRA image. Do not embed a child window.
.trellis/spec/frontend/component-guidelines.md:11: trailing whitespace.
+- Stable element ids, once GPUI is linked. Do not rebuild identity from a translated label.
.trellis/spec/frontend/component-guidelines.md:12: trailing whitespace.
+
.trellis/spec/frontend/component-guidelines.md:13: trailing whitespace.
+## Not yet in the tree
.trellis/spec/frontend/component-guidelines.md:14: trailing whitespace.
+
.trellis/spec/frontend/component-guidelines.md:15: trailing whitespace.
+GPUI types (`Render`, `Context`, `Window`) are intentionally absent so this crate builds without Zed. The first UI task adds `gpui-kit` 0.7.3 (or a git dependency on `zed-industries/zed` tag `v1.23.3`) and updates ADR-001.
.trellis/spec/frontend/component-guidelines.md:16: trailing whitespace.
+
.trellis/spec/frontend/component-guidelines.md:17: trailing whitespace.
+## Forbidden
