+Consume the parent design §3 owned monitor identity and explicit confidence/scale-source fields. Windows interface paths are connection-scoped, not guaranteed stable across port changes. Geometry must come from a complete cross-checked enumeration. A TopologyEvent::Unavailable makes Audience unavailable: task07 curtains/stops/closes the audience and never continues from last-known geometry; recovery does not auto-start. Task09 shows diagnostic warnings and identity confidence. Task07 must verify GdiDeviceCapsRatio scale (a process-context ratio, not verified effective DPI) against the actual GPUI DPI context before using geometry fallback; ambiguity rejects Start. Polling is owned by platform, with cancellation; no extra hidden window listener.
